<div data-toggle-group="mainmenu" data-toggle-id="menu-show" data-toggle-class="rug-hidden-m--block" class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-16-24">
<div class="rug-panel--content rug-panel--content--border">
<h1 class="rug-mb-0 rug-clearfix">Bachelor's Open Day</h1>
</div>
<div id="target-content-holder"></div>
<div class="rug-showcase rug-showcase--visual rug-mb-l">
<div class="rug-showcase__content rug-showcase__content--cover">
<div class="rug-showcase__slide rug-showcase__slide--image rug-showcase__slide--current">
<div class="rug-showcase__slide__background"></div>
<img src="/education/bachelor/bachelor-open-day/images/image-header-crop.jpg" alt="An image of five students"><div class="rug-showcase__label">
<div class="rug-h2 rug-font-white rug-mb-0">
<span class="rug-mr">Bachelor's Open Day</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<button hidden="hidden" class="rug-showcase__play-visual" aria-label=""></button><button class="rug-showcase__pause-visual" aria-label="Pause slides"></button>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p>Have you already looked at the website and brochures but want to know more? Then visit one of our Bachelor's Open Days! The next Bachelor's Open Day will take place on Friday 30 October 2026.</p>
<p>If you have previously attended a Bachelor's Open Day then the logical next step would be to sign up for a Student for a Day event or a Web Class. Attending another open day will not prove to be beneficial as the information provided mostly stays the same.</p>
<p>
<em>Curious which UG programme is the best fit for you? </em><a href="https://web.intractive.app/ZoZaXbo" target="_blank"><em>Take our Bachelor's Quiz</em></a><em> and discover which direction matches your interests.</em>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div><div data-toggle-group="mainmenu" data-toggle-id="menu-show" data-toggle-class="rug-hidden-m--block" class="">
