<div class="rug-layout__item rug-layout__column-item">
<h2 class="rug-h4 rug-mb-s rug-font-default js--equal rug-text-hyphenate">Registration</h2>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p>Friday 30 October 2026 we will organise the next Bachelor's Open Day about all our Bachelor's degree programmes.<br>
<br>Registration via this site starts on <strong>Monday 12 October 2026 at 5 pm Dutch time</strong>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<h4>
<strong>Reminder Service</strong>
</h4>
<p>Would you like to receive an email the moment you can assemble your personal programme for the Bachelor's Open Day? Please leave your details via the button below.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-mb-xm">
<a href="https://go.rug.nl/form/reminderservicebacheloropendag30okt2026" class="rug-button rug-button--secondary rug-button--medium rug-mr-s rug-button__grid-two" target="_blank">Reminder Service Bachelor's Open Day<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
</div>
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<h4>Contact</h4>
<p>If you have any questions regarding the Bachelor's Open Day, you can reach us at <span class="js--decode" data-encoded="PGEgaHJlZj0ibWFpbHRvOnN0dWRpZWtpZXplcnNAcnVnLm5sIj5zdHVkaWVraWV6ZXJzQHJ1Zy5ubDwvYT4=">studiekiezers rug.nl</span> or take a look at the <a href="/education/bachelor/bachelor-open-day/veelgestelde-vragen">Frequently Asked Questions</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
